i><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rivals and Influence</strong> - Endgame competitors will support government policy changes in their own interests. Generate your own influence to do the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real City Pathfinding</strong> - Maps are based on real cities. Travel time depends on actual road and rail networks, as well as obstacles like rivers and mountains.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459490/extras/6ae7c703b73e28f3c0df6a08b58b19f8.poster.avif?t=1764523300\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459490/extras/6ae7c703b73e28f3c0df6a08b58b19f8.webm?t=1764523300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459490/extras/6ae7c703b73e28f3c0df6a08b58b19f8.mp4?t=1764523300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moddability</strong> - Create your own careers, courses, locations, possessions and more. All content designed to be highly moddable.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Poking Water Games"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459490/34187643e5a7deaca18de36fc48bcf1d39bf10ab/header.jpg?t=1764523300","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2459490/1115124921/4d6ad39d478b0587a2ae4274ca335f0c57d63af9/1750921414/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747118530","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2459490/1115124921/4d6ad39d478b0587a2ae4274ca335f0c57d63af9/1750921414/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747118530","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steam